# Google Mobile Ads and the User Messaging Platform (AdMob PRD §12.2). Both SDKs ship their own
# consumer rules; these keep the classes their mediation and rendering code reaches by reflection.
# Release builds run with R8 off today, so these only matter once it is turned on.
-keep class com.google.android.gms.ads.** { *; }
-keep class com.google.ads.** { *; }
-keep class com.google.android.ump.** { *; }
# Mediation adapters add their own rules here when they are integrated.
